# ProDesign (user)

You have ProDesign installed globally. When work touches UI, layout, styling, components, navigation, forms, or copy:

1. Read `~/.cursor/skills/prodesign/SKILL.md`
2. Then `~/.cursor/skills/prodesign/docs/apply.md` — pick the pattern, do not invent one. Named parts → `docs/ui/elements.md`. User jobs → `docs/ui/flows.md`
3. If the product has `.cursor/skills/prodesign/`, use that copy instead
4. If `SYSTEM.md` exists, obey it. If not, studio + `apply-system.mjs`, then fill it
5. Phone ≠ desktop patterns. Same tokens
6. Scan when the skill is in the repo. Critical = 0

Hard bans: no gradients, no emoji, one installed icon pack (not Lucide, not handmade paths), four states on every data container.
